# ======================================================================
# Radiance material library for the office test-room models.
# Auto-derived from the exported .mtl files (reflectances) + Rad_* names.
#   opaque surfaces  -> void plastic  (diffuse reflectance = Kd = name suffix R0NN)
#   glazing (T073)   -> void glass    (73% normal transmittance -> transmissivity below)
#   monitor screen   -> void plastic  (4% reflectance, slight specular)
#   luminaire (L09)  -> void plastic 0.80 (NON-emissive, per Ke=0 in the .mtl).
#                       To make it a real light source, replace its block with e.g.:
#                       void light Rad_Luminaire_L09  0 0 3  <R> <R> <R>
# Use:  oconv materials.rad <model>.rad > <model>.oct
# ======================================================================

